      "original_selected_source": "/-- **A multiple test blow-up of a restriction `𝔟|_S` has its centres in the strict transforms of `S`.** -/\ntheorem centresIn_of_isGeoTestTower_withN (𝔟 : MarkedIdeal n X) (S : Set X) :\n    {Y : CMfd.{u} n} → (T : BlowupTower X Y) → IsGeoTestTower (withN 𝔟 S) T → CentresIn S T\n  | _, .refl, _ => trivial\n  | _, .step T C π hπ, hT => by\n      obtain ⟨hT0, hC⟩ := (isGeoTestTower_step_iff _ T C π hπ).mp hT\n      refine ⟨centresIn_of_isGeoTestTower_withN 𝔟 S T hT0, fun x hx => ?_⟩\n      rw [← N_geoTransformAlong_withN 𝔟 S T]\n      exact hC.subset_N hx\n"
    },
    {
      "native_name": "TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.CoefficientIdealRestriction.isCoherent_coeffMarked",
      "public_name": "Hironaka.CoefficientIdealRestriction.isCoherent_coeffMarked",
      "original_lines": [
        241,
        243
      ],
      "sha256": "2076befa71adc5216e6e45541e6689a8818b43b04201dba9524a6d02076f3af2",
      "original_selected_source": "theorem isCoherent_coeffMarked {𝔪 : MarkedIdeal n X} (hN : 𝔪.N = univ) (h𝔞 : 𝔪.ideal.IsCoherent) :\n    (coeffMarked 𝔪).ideal.IsCoherent :=\n  (isAmbientFamily_derivMarked hN h𝔞).isCoherent_msum\n"
    },
    {
      "native_name": "TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.CoefficientIdealRestriction.cosupp_coeff_withN",
      "public_name": "Hironaka.CoefficientIdealRestriction.cosupp_coeff_withN",
      "original_lines": [
        245,
        253
      ],
      "sha256": "a70ba4f402d719a2df49d1dcd7fabb4ddb0892a318fd421c48d56d36a17640f7",
      "original_selected_source": "/-- **Włodarczyk `le:S`, the support** (GGT Proposition 5.6.4, first statement): for `𝔪 = (X, X, E, 𝔞, μ)` with\n`𝔞` coherent and `μ ≥ 1`, and ANY set `S`, `supp(𝔪) ∩ S = supp(𝓒(𝔪)|_S)`. -/\ntheorem cosupp_coeff_withN (𝔪 : MarkedIdeal n X) (hN : 𝔪.N = univ) (h𝔞 : 𝔪.ideal.IsCoherent) (hd : 1 ≤ 𝔪.d)\n    (S : Set X) : (withN (coeffMarked 𝔪) S).cosupp = 𝔪.cosupp ∩ S := by\n  refine Subset.antisymm (fun x hx => ⟨cosupport_coeff_subset hN h𝔞 hd S hx, hx.1⟩) ?_\n  have h0 := (coeff_tower 𝔪 hN h𝔞 hd (BlowupTower.refl : BlowupTower X X)).2 trivial\n  rw [geoTransformAlong_refl, geoTransformAlong_refl] at h0\n  rw [← h0]\n  exact cosupp_inter_subset_cosupp_withN (𝔟 := coeffMarked 𝔪) hN S\n"
    }
  ],
